        "push_content_up": false,
        "content_color": "#000000",
        "eyebrow": "Our Journey",
        "eyebrow_color": "#b91f1c",
        "title": "Over 30 years of fun",
        "content": "<p>Founded by Linda Adamson in 1994, Love to Sing began as a small New Zealand children's music company born from a passion for quality kids' songs. What started with songbooks published by Scholastic NZ has grown into a globally loved music brand with over 400 songs, over a billion YouTube views and listeners in every country. Love to Sing has five YouTube channels, with Christmas Songs & Carols - Love to Sing becoming one of the biggest Christmas music channels in the world. From classrooms in New Zealand to living rooms across the globe, our mission remains the same - to connect people of all ages through the joy of singing together.<br/><br/></p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_url": ""
      }
    },
    "image_and_text_XY6qbe": {
      "type": "image-and-text",
      "blocks": {
