      "name": "t:sections.image-and-text.name",
      "settings": {
        "background": "#F4F4F4",
        "flip_content": false,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/ove-to-sing-choir-symphony-under-the-stars-big-screen_jpg.jpg",
        "push_content_up": false,
        "content_color": "#000000",
        "eyebrow": "From New Zealand to the World",
        "eyebrow_color": "#b91f1c",
        "title": "Growing, changing and reaching new audiences",
        "content": "<p>The Love to Sing catalogue grew from illustrated songbooks and cassettes into CDs, videos, DVDs, fitness programmes and teaching resources, reaching both education and retail markets before expanding into national television. Generations of Love to Sing choirs and Action Kids also brought the music to life on stage - from schools, libraries and community shows to some of New Zealand’s largest outdoor events, with audiences of more than 200,000 people. Love to Sing music and products were also published, licensed and distributed internationally, taking a New Zealand family business into markets around the world.<br/><br/></p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_url": ""
      }
    },
