      "settings": {
        "background": "#ffffff",
        "flip_content": true,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/inda-adamson-early-love-to-sing-show-guitar-children_jpg.jpg",
        "push_content_up": false,
        "content_color": "#000000",
        "eyebrow": "Created with Love",
        "eyebrow_color": "#b91f1c",
        "title": "Happy Vibrations Around the World",
        "content": "<p>Long before YouTube or digital streaming, Linda had a simple dream: to create happy vibrations around the world through music. Today, Love to Sing brings together original songs written by Linda and much-loved traditional music, reaching audiences through YouTube, Spotify and other digital platforms and generating billions of views and streams worldwide. More than three decades later, Linda continues to write new music alongside Tessa, Mark and the wider Love to Sing creative team. The technology and audiences may have changed enormously, but the idea behind Love to Sing remains wonderfully simple: Connecting the world through the power of song.<br/></p>",
