          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "content": "Hello There,\nMy name is Henry Salmon, and after a visit to my grandchildren, and great grandchildren over Christmas at Kati Kati, NZ, they introduced me to your wonderful disc of AT THE ZOO, and I at the age of ninety five, I enjoyed it as much as they did, and it gave me the idea of purchasing a couple, and letting the old folk at the home where I also am a tenant, to participate in that enjoyment.",
